.TH CONFIGURE-MPD 1 "September 2025" "hifiberry-mpd" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
configure-mpd \- configure MPD for HiFiBerry devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B configure-mpd
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B configure-mpd
is a utility script that configures the Music Player Daemon (MPD) for optimal operation on HiFiBerry devices. It sets up device-specific audio output configurations and other HiFiBerry-related settings.
.PP
This script is typically run automatically during system configuration but can also be executed manually to reconfigure MPD settings.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/mpd/mpd.conf
Default MPD configuration template
.TP
.I ~/.config/mpd/mpd.conf
User-specific MPD configuration file
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mpd (1),
.BR mpc (1),
.BR mpd-set-permissions (1)
.SH AUTHOR
HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>